    "updated_at": "2026-04-28T01:44:53Z",
    "body": "To avoid a breaking API change the best workaround I can think of is for methods which depend on the current configuration to query it from the operating system before taking actions based on the previously cached value and raise an error if the mismatch prevents the operation from succeeding. To my knowledge no platform provides an event when there is a configuration change.",
